WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.998
Today you say the sounds of a word, and your child pushes them together.

2
00:00:04.448 --> 00:00:11.260
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.340
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:20.466
Say the names of the six pictures in job one. Then pick one, and say its sounds like this.

5
00:00:26.415 --> 00:00:27.353
The word is sun.

6
00:00:28.253 --> 00:00:32.947
Listen to how slow it is, and how clean each sound is. Here is another one.

7
00:00:38.778 --> 00:00:39.793
The word is map.

8
00:00:40.693 --> 00:00:46.953
Your child says the word and touches the picture. The sounds are printed small below the pictures, for you.

9
00:00:47.403 --> 00:00:51.630
If your child is stuck, say the sounds again, closer together. Like this.

10
00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:57.375
The word is map.

11
00:00:58.275 --> 00:01:02.195
Do not say the word for them. Say the sounds once more, closer still.

12
00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:06.562
For job two, press play on your child's listening track and step away.

13
00:01:07.012 --> 00:01:13.737
Your child touches a dot for each sound and says the word. The voice waits, then says the sounds and the word.

14
00:01:14.187 --> 00:01:18.240
Your child does not have to read the letters. The dots are for touching.

15
00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:23.421
At the end, your child says three of the pictures slowly for you, then as a whole word.
